CATEGORIES:Columbia Pictures
DESCRIPTION:When recently single Steven moves into his new apartment\, cab
 le guy Chip comes to hook him upâand doesn't let go. Initially\, Chip is 
 just overzealous in his desire to be Steven's pal\, but when Steven tries
  to end the 'friendship'\, Chip shows his dark side. He begins stalking S
 teven\, who's left to fend for himself because no one else can believe Ch
 ip's capable of such behaviour.
